986 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 421 0 R
/E (Most of the carbon in turning rice husk ash into high-purity silicon comes from magnesium and energy-intensive processing, so targeted action can cut it sharply. Base uses grid power and fresh magnesium; Improved adds 50% renewable power and partial magnesium recycling; Best uses 90% renewable power and 80% recycling. Moving from Base to Best makes the route a competitive low-carbon, circular source of silicon for India's battery anode manufacturers.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [81]
>>
endobj
